{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"An elf can be seen walking around the bay looking for essences.","created_at":"2021-07-16T10:02:04.370000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865533739644092416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Seeing nothing, the elf moves towards a massive tree, over-looking the ocean. He leans on it and slumps to the ground. His first day back to the land of the living and he feels compelled to stay around in the borough he was revived in. It is rather pretty in here.","created_at":"2021-07-16T10:05:44.045000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865534661027823616","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"He thinks about all that happened. He lost his name, he lost something about himself. Who is he now?","created_at":"2021-07-16T10:06:35.340000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865534876173729802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Before he wouldn't have had an answer, but now he has. He's Seraxa's financial advisor, he's Meorys's crime solving partner, and the pilot of their crew. Slowly he feels a sense of something growing within him. He smiles at this, maybe it's not names or memories that make someone who they are. If not, then what does?","created_at":"2021-07-16T10:08:37.774000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865535389699145768","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"The elf sighs as he draws a blank on his current train of thought, there would be other opportunities to think about that. For now, he'd settle being a pilot, he grips his silver wings, and settle on being a friend. He should also try to meet more people, make more friends, maybe increase their crew. Another smile graces his face at the possibilities. He gives one look at the stars above before closing his eyes.","created_at":"2021-07-16T10:10:45.717000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865535926331768833","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
