{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"As you drink, it feels warm and fuzzy on the insides of your throat, a feeling which spreads through your body. You are unable to lie to Prosser for the next hour.","created_at":"2021-07-20T06:54:57.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866936201596239882","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They look to you and nod. \"Do you or have you ever worked for the crown, directly or indirectly? If so, when and what was your job?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T06:58:34.167000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866937110968008716","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I have never worked for the crown.\" The nameless responds plainly.","created_at":"2021-07-20T06:58:59.541000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866937217393098812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"All my work has been, writing for the Empire Post and a couple of missions in the flight school.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:01:07.190000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866937752791941120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod. \"What are your opinions on the current occupation of the Americas by the British and the British crown in general?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:03:30.005000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866938351800942632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"I haven't thought much about it just yet. All I know is that I won't allow the redcoats to continue bombing and harrassing the city. My friends are all here in the city and I won't allow them to come to harm.","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:05:31.055000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866938859521703986","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"They nod once more. \"Are you willing to go to drastic measures and far lengths to ensure the end of tyranny and freedom from occupation for the peoples of Empire city and beyond?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:08:07.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866939515951382528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"For my friends, those who I have already met and those who I will,\" The last part of what he said slightly surprises the nameless, he hasn't thought of that but something compels him to say it right now, \"I am.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:10:17.168000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866940059566342145","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Prosser smiles and extends a hand. \"Welcome aboard.\" They will continue rowing once their hand is shook","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:11:10.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866940283153678397","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"The nameless shakes their hand. \"Glad to be here.\" He smiles. He has gained a more allies and more power to fight. Long ago he would've been happy at just acruing power, but now it was not the power that made him happy, instead at what he could use it for.","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:13:36.046000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866940893722705931","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"||REDACTED||","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:19:06.316000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-23T09:50:04.839000Z","id":"866942278974177322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
