{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Prosser nods and whistles, and the figure who you assume to be Trapero turns around. You notice that they aren't just siblings, but identical twins. Trapero comes over and extends a hand. \"This the nameless one you told me about?\" They ask to their sibling before looking at you. \"Trapero. A pleasure.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:27:24.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866944366609825793","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"unashaminglyme","id":"340062533304057857","is_bot":0,"username":"unashaminglyme"},"author_id":"340062533304057857","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"\"Pleasure's all mine.\" The nameless says as he accepts the handshake. \"Quite the operation you got going here, I'm ready to be of service.\" He says with steel in his eyes.","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:28:27.606000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866944633194676234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Trapero smiles. \"Another eager one, eh? Well don't you worry, there's always work to be done in a revolution.\" They nod and lead you off to a different section of the docks.","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:34:13.770000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866946085113298995","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
