{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"862869435940339732","content":"Trapero chuckles. \"Well let's start small, ok?\" They will explain to you the basics of shipping, stealth, supplies, and sabotage while giving a tour. (That's all I have for you at the moment, though the will be more opportunities forthcoming)","created_at":"2021-07-20T07:40:00.161000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866947537981800448","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
